OL,3,GNEWSARNLI reviews security after
OL,4,Avolunteers targeted online
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe RNLI is reviewing its security
OL,7,Fprocedures to ensure the safety of its
OL,8,Fmembers after protests in Dover and
OL,9,FPortsmouth which saw its members
OL,10,Ftargeted.
OL,12,FAs part of this, volunteers have been
OL,13,Ftold to consider not wearing RNLI
OL,14,Fbranded clothing in some circumstances
OL,15,Fwhile representing the charity.
OL,17,FIt comes after the charity helped carry
OL,18,Faround 120 migrants intercepted off the
OL,19,FIsle of Wight, to Eastney, in Langstone
OL,20,FHarbour, where roads were blocked by
OL,21,Fprotesters.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
